      "writtenOn": "2025-05-29T18:59:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I would in general suggest to reflect the REST API endpoint path in the package structure. As Nasser said doing that properly by using the account*s* plural is a breaking change, but at least I would suggest to have a subpackage per `child()` resource as defined in the respective `RestApiModule`.\n\n+1\n\n\u003e \n\u003e I would propose to do that change for all endpoints and in a separate change, which might either be merged before or after this series. I would be happy to prepare that. WDYT?\n\nIf you\u0027re willing to do that I think it would be great. @ekempin@google.com would adding these subpackages for REST APIs be a concern for you/Google?",
      "parentUuid": "5c05da85_2dd744da",
      "revId": "a99dd98f2f2bf7bf3b529325931ed364d5b3100e",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
